            "notes": "This is where you decide if you need to go support soldier auto-aim/ability hybrid. The real core of this is eye of the spider and pulse converter. wanna shoot more? Double rockets and reload on ability use lets you go burrrrrrrrr for longer.  Need anti-heal but can't trust auto-aim for hs rockets with anti-heal give aoe anti's. \n\nAuto-aim/Ability Hybrid Build:\n\nEye of the Spider.\nPulse Converter ammo restore\nDouble rockets + reload on ability use for sustained damage output that converts well into finishing a kill.\n\nAnti-heal Focused Build:\n\nManual aim?  rockets with anti-heal properties\nAoE anti-heal capabilities!?\n\nThe choice seems to come down to whether you prioritize:\n\nSustained DPS (the \"burrrrrrr\" build with double rockets and ability-based reloads)\nUtility/Counter-play (anti-heal to shut down enemy healing)",
